<title>AUSTRIA: Austria July yr/yr inflation 1.0 pct vs June 1.2.</title>
<headline>Austria July yr/yr inflation 1.0 pct vs June 1.2.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN INFLATION		  JULY*    JUNE    JULY 1996**</p>
<p> Monthly CPI index move	   -0.1	0.0	 0.9</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation		  1.0	1.2	 1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1996)		 101.2    101.3     131.8</p>
<p>NOTES -- * preliminary figures</p>
<p>	    ** base 1986</p>
